LIUQIN: FocalTech fts_ts touch over GENI SPI, polled every 8 ms, reporting
through liuqin_hid_touch.  SE0 (0x00980000) with reset 17/irq 51 is probed
first, then SE1 (0x00990000) with 20/21.  The engine is left configured by the
bootloader like the UFS host; coordinates 1080x2340 are rescaled to the
digitizer's 1800x2880 here.  liuqinfts=0 disables.
